  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"ucb309408\" id=\"ucb309408\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue956e539\" id=\"ue956e539\">简单说：</span></p><ul list=\"u7ca81592\"><li fid=\"uce5e5e21\" data-lake-id=\"u57babd72\" id=\"u57babd72\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub053d37b\" id=\"ub053d37b\">BERT 微调</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u47869546\" id=\"u47869546\">：让模型从几个固定答案中选一个。</span></li><li fid=\"uce5e5e21\" data-lake-id=\"ube14aeac\" id=\"ube14aeac\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc64c2c70\" id=\"uc64c2c70\">千问微调</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u28892c07\" id=\"u28892c07\">：让模型逐字生成一段答案或 JSON。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u590a6386\" id=\"u590a6386\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3b48edd7\" id=\"u3b48edd7\">数据格式</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2d92fa9b\" id=\"u2d92fa9b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3ef7748c\" id=\"u3ef7748c\">BERT 的训练数据非常简单：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5C%22text%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22%E5%A4%8D%E7%8E%B0%E8%BF%99%E7%AF%87%E8%AE%BA%E6%96%87%E5%B9%B6%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%E6%B6%88%E8%9E%8D%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22label%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22Paper_Reproduction%5C%22%7D%5Cn%7B%5C%22text%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%20LangChain%20%E5%92%8C%20LlamaIndex%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22label%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22Framework_Evaluation%5C%22%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22T9slA%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u51b9215d\" id=\"u51b9215d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9325ad3c\" id=\"u9325ad3c\">千问通常使用对话式数据：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%20%20%5C%22messages%5C%22%3A%20%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7B%5C%22role%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22user%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22content%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22%E5%A4%8D%E7%8E%B0%E8%BF%99%E7%AF%87%E8%AE%BA%E6%96%87%E5%B9%B6%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%E6%B6%88%E8%9E%8D%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C%5C%22%7D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22role%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22assistant%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22content%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22%7B%5C%5C%5C%22intent_type%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%5C%5C%5C%22Paper_Reproduction%5C%5C%5C%22%2C%5C%5C%5C%22entities%5C%5C%5C%22%3A%7B%5C%5C%5C%22needs_ablation%5C%5C%5C%22%3Atrue%7D%7D%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%5D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22COVLS%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ufb6981e5\" id=\"ufb6981e5\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubefdac6f\" id=\"ubefdac6f\">训练目标</span></strong></p><table data-lake-id=\"ASlp4\" id=\"ASlp4\" margin=\"true\" class=\"lake-table\" style=\"width: 750px\"><colgroup><col width=\"250\"><col width=\"250\"><col width=\"250\"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id=\"u3c855c98\" id=\"u3c855c98\"><td data-lake-id=\"uff62e33a\" id=\"uff62e33a\"><p data-lake-id=\"ucfd0bcad\" id=\"ucfd0bcad\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3266fe46\" id=\"u3266fe46\">对比项</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u2bcf97d0\" id=\"u2bcf97d0\"><p data-lake-id=\"ufaea8afb\" id=\"ufaea8afb\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud6a84ba0\" id=\"ud6a84ba0\">BERT 分类微调</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"uaad77456\" id=\"uaad77456\"><p data-lake-id=\"u3d83cf85\" id=\"u3d83cf85\"><span data-lake-id=\"uca27f559\" id=\"uca27f559\">千问 LoRA/SFT</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u5d4f91d2\" id=\"u5d4f91d2\"><td data-lake-id=\"u1aa7486a\" id=\"u1aa7486a\"><p data-lake-id=\"u46fba96c\" id=\"u46fba96c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufff14c15\" id=\"ufff14c15\">学习目标</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ub0b4eb01\" id=\"ub0b4eb01\"><p data-lake-id=\"uc961c22c\" id=\"uc961c22c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u74542fd9\" id=\"u74542fd9\">预测一个类别</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"uec88b0ec\" id=\"uec88b0ec\"><p data-lake-id=\"ue4615224\" id=\"ue4615224\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7744d4ec\" id=\"u7744d4ec\">逐字生成目标 JSON</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"ud6369046\" id=\"ud6369046\"><td data-lake-id=\"uadac2300\" id=\"uadac2300\"><p data-lake-id=\"u73bc9be4\" id=\"u73bc9be4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u19a5c081\" id=\"u19a5c081\">损失函数</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u8c4cefb1\" id=\"u8c4cefb1\"><p data-lake-id=\"u0279c264\" id=\"u0279c264\"><span data-lake-id=\"u843b9ac8\" id=\"u843b9ac8\">分类交叉熵</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u252f7885\" id=\"u252f7885\"><p data-lake-id=\"u855ba8f6\" id=\"u855ba8f6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9c8bf066\" id=\"u9c8bf066\">下一个 Token 预测损失</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u1f6c813a\" id=\"u1f6c813a\"><td data-lake-id=\"u752bf9c6\" id=\"u752bf9c6\"><p data-lake-id=\"u0e13ab9b\" id=\"u0e13ab9b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5238d9ca\" id=\"u5238d9ca\">修改参数</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"uc3a2152d\" id=\"uc3a2152d\"><p data-lake-id=\"u69500cba\" id=\"u69500cba\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0fc3574a\" id=\"u0fc3574a\">通常全量微调</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ue8290f45\" id=\"ue8290f45\"><p data-lake-id=\"ubdb40826\" id=\"ubdb40826\"><span data-lake-id=\"u03153912\" id=\"u03153912\">通常只训练 LoRA 参数</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u2e349f0c\" id=\"u2e349f0c\"><td data-lake-id=\"u720da588\" id=\"u720da588\"><p data-lake-id=\"udcef979b\" id=\"udcef979b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6fddf15e\" id=\"u6fddf15e\">输出</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u125e7a98\" id=\"u125e7a98\"><p data-lake-id=\"u39f35c7a\" id=\"u39f35c7a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud21ae894\" id=\"ud21ae894\">固定标签和概率</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u1f7a7e0a\" id=\"u1f7a7e0a\"><p data-lake-id=\"u2ecc09f2\" id=\"u2ecc09f2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u95761581\" id=\"u95761581\">任意长度文本</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"ucd97f80a\" id=\"ucd97f80a\"><td data-lake-id=\"ue6f3ea47\" id=\"ue6f3ea47\"><p data-lake-id=\"ub48cf40a\" id=\"ub48cf40a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1602c271\" id=\"u1602c271\">推理方式</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u2e71090e\" id=\"u2e71090e\"><p data-lake-id=\"ufde0d621\" id=\"ufde0d621\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua5fe25ec\" id=\"ua5fe25ec\">一次前向计算</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u3ba93c28\" id=\"u3ba93c28\"><p data-lake-id=\"u4e6e3160\" id=\"u4e6e3160\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubc2af9b2\" id=\"ubc2af9b2\">一个 Token 一个 Token 生成</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u0fca749f\" id=\"u0fca749f\"><td data-lake-id=\"ufb45851f\" id=\"ufb45851f\"><p data-lake-id=\"u1f2d96a7\" id=\"u1f2d96a7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6071cb59\" id=\"u6071cb59\">JSON 稳定性</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"uc5291b66\" id=\"uc5291b66\"><p data-lake-id=\"uc9cc1c27\" id=\"uc9cc1c27\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7bd839ce\" id=\"u7bd839ce\">不涉及 JSON</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ua94394e1\" id=\"ua94394e1\"><p data-lake-id=\"ucbce9638\" id=\"ucbce9638\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2d1d9084\" id=\"u2d1d9084\">可能出现格式错误</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u8ace9ee9\" id=\"u8ace9ee9\"><td data-lake-id=\"uc11813d6\" id=\"uc11813d6\"><p data-lake-id=\"u4c7ac983\" id=\"u4c7ac983\"><span data-lake-id=\"u48d1a231\" id=\"u48d1a231\">置信度</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u34736a22\" id=\"u34736a22\"><p data-lake-id=\"u9c06d949\" id=\"u9c06d949\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf91c64c1\" id=\"uf91c64c1\">Softmax 概率较直接</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ueb45117d\" id=\"ueb45117d\"><p data-lake-id=\"uaa08bc68\" id=\"uaa08bc68\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubf72c090\" id=\"ubf72c090\">很难得到可靠分类置信度</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"uc6a54f10\" id=\"uc6a54f10\"><td data-lake-id=\"ub0e4c61d\" id=\"ub0e4c61d\"><p data-lake-id=\"u103dd5e6\" id=\"u103dd5e6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufecbcb0e\" id=\"ufecbcb0e\">部署成本</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u14279108\" id=\"u14279108\"><p data-lake-id=\"uada39ff1\" id=\"uada39ff1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1f737263\" id=\"u1f737263\">较低，可用 CPU</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u14bcf213\" id=\"u14bcf213\"><p data-lake-id=\"uf7ddd56c\" id=\"uf7ddd56c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5a484c9\" id=\"ue5a484c9\">较高，通常更依赖 GPU</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u9605e9e0\" id=\"u9605e9e0\"><td data-lake-id=\"u3dfaf22f\" id=\"u3dfaf22f\"><p data-lake-id=\"u296b715a\" id=\"u296b715a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u187a4984\" id=\"u187a4984\">能否抽实体</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u0195ee30\" id=\"u0195ee30\"><p data-lake-id=\"uf70269ff\" id=\"uf70269ff\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub11fc380\" id=\"ub11fc380\">需要额外模型或规则</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ubbfc48fb\" id=\"ubbfc48fb\"><p data-lake-id=\"u192314ec\" id=\"u192314ec\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8825775e\" id=\"u8825775e\">可以同时生成实体</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id=\"ufa0c3626\" id=\"ufa0c3626\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u07d8ad0e\" id=\"u07d8ad0e\">BERT 怎么训练</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AC%5Cn%20%20%20%E2%86%93%5CnTokenizer%5Cn%20%20%20%E2%86%93%5CnBERT%20%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%5Cn%20%20%20%E2%86%93%5Cn%E5%8F%96%20%5BCLS%5D%20%E5%90%91%E9%87%8F%5Cn%20%20%20%E2%86%93%5Cn%E7%BA%BF%E6%80%A7%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%E5%A4%B4%5Cn%20%20%20%E2%86%93%5Cn%E5%9B%9B%E4%B8%AA%E7%B1%BB%E5%88%AB%E7%9A%84%E6%A6%82%E7%8E%87%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YNTN5%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u19af75a3\" id=\"u19af75a3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubf192d51\" id=\"ubf192d51\">假设模型输出：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%20%20%5C%22Paper_Reproduction%5C%22%3A%200.96%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22Code_Execution%5C%22%3A%200.02%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22Framework_Evaluation%5C%22%3A%200.01%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22General%5C%22%3A%200.01%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ki69i%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uf4acec0d\" id=\"uf4acec0d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u51e7a7ff\" id=\"u51e7a7ff\">训练时只需让正确类别的概率越来越高。对于 BGE-small、mBERT 这种规模，V100 可以直接全量微调。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3a901f30\" id=\"u3a901f30\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue44e906d\" id=\"ue44e906d\">千问怎么训练</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AC%20%2B%20%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%5Cn%20%20%20%E2%86%93%5CnQwen%5Cn%20%20%20%E2%86%93%5Cn%E9%80%90%E5%AD%97%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%20JSON%5Cn%20%20%20%E2%86%93%5CnJSON%20%E6%A0%A1%E9%AA%8C%E5%92%8C%E5%AD%97%E6%AE%B5%E6%A3%80%E6%9F%A5%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DGwg3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u6cb3d9fb\" id=\"u6cb3d9fb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u052b1f42\" id=\"u052b1f42\">训练时不会只学习“这是论文复现”，而是学习生成完整字符串：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5C%22intent_type%5C%22%3A%5C%22Paper_Reproduction%5C%22%2C%5C%22entities%5C%22%3A%7B%5C%22needs_ablation%5C%22%3Atrue%7D%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CTw35%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u91409171\" id=\"u91409171\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf932099f\" id=\"uf932099f\">通常做法是：</span></p><ol list=\"ubbfc4154\"><li fid=\"u655f30ef\" data-lake-id=\"u138b75aa\" id=\"u138b75aa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u85231401\" id=\"u85231401\">加载 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uf43fe52f\" id=\"uf43fe52f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u64f8f4f7\" id=\"u64f8f4f7\">Qwen3-0.6B</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u260da39a\" id=\"u260da39a\"> 基础模型。</span></li><li fid=\"u655f30ef\" data-lake-id=\"u3e1a0b71\" id=\"u3e1a0b71\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucb6a4d9a\" id=\"ucb6a4d9a\">在注意力层插入 LoRA 参数。</span></li><li fid=\"u655f30ef\" data-lake-id=\"u9cb01b80\" id=\"u9cb01b80\"><span data-lake-id=\"u980eb3ed\" id=\"u980eb3ed\">冻结大部分原始参数。</span></li><li fid=\"u655f30ef\" data-lake-id=\"u83ca98a6\" id=\"u83ca98a6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9e36c0aa\" id=\"u9e36c0aa\">只训练 LoRA。</span></li><li fid=\"u655f30ef\" data-lake-id=\"u132b9519\" id=\"u132b9519\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc2912a38\" id=\"uc2912a38\">保存“基础模型版本 + LoRA Adapter”。</span></li><li fid=\"u655f30ef\" data-lake-id=\"u096987ee\" id=\"u096987ee\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue05733bc\" id=\"ue05733bc\">推理时加载两者并生成 JSON。</span></li><li fid=\"u655f30ef\" data-lake-id=\"u4a1b9c27\" id=\"u4a1b9c27\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6bef4105\" id=\"u6bef4105\">后端验证 JSON，不合法时重试或回退规则。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u3d189fee\" id=\"u3d189fee\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub6a4f590\" id=\"ub6a4f590\">V100 使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u13a56ac9\" id=\"u13a56ac9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8dee9048\" id=\"u8dee9048\">FP16</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc2915e7f\" id=\"uc2915e7f\">，不使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u932718f3\" id=\"u932718f3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6e7f646c\" id=\"u6e7f646c\">BF16</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf3756e54\" id=\"uf3756e54\">。0.6B 模型比较小，一般不必上复杂的 4-bit QLoRA，普通 FP16 LoRA 就够了。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubef2609d\" id=\"ubef2609d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u16e03b73\" id=\"u16e03b73\">数据要求也不同</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub6aacc16\" id=\"ub6aacc16\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua9f927a9\" id=\"ua9f927a9\">BERT 只需要标注意图：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%A5%E8%AF%9D%20%E2%86%92%20%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NRtVc%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ua9edfd33\" id=\"ua9edfd33\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubecf5011\" id=\"ubecf5011\">千问需要完整标注：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%A5%E8%AF%9D%20%E2%86%92%20%E6%84%8F%E5%9B%BE%20%2B%20%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%20%2B%20%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%20%2B%20%E4%B8%A5%E6%A0%BC%20JSON%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aCVGh%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ub44c1ae9\" id=\"ub44c1ae9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua2270a34\" id=\"ua2270a34\">例如下面这些字段都要人工确定：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%20%20%5C%22paper_title%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22Attention%20Is%20All%20You%20Need%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22needs_ablation%5C%22%3A%20true%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22max_experiments%5C%22%3A%203%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22reproduction_mode%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22smoke%5C%22%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Jzq4E%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u0bbe3a8e\" id=\"u0bbe3a8e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9d8ab582\" id=\"u9d8ab582\">如果训练数据中的 JSON 风格不一致，千问就容易生成不稳定结果。因此千问的数据制作成本明显更高。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uedb112a6\" id=\"uedb112a6\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u574012ce\" id=\"u574012ce\">千问也可以做普通分类</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua7bcb7fa\" id=\"ua7bcb7fa\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5e4402e\" id=\"ue5e4402e\">还可以把 Qwen 当成编码器，在最后增加分类头。这样训练过程会更接近 BERT：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22Qwen%20%E9%9A%90%E8%97%8F%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%20%E2%86%92%20%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%E5%A4%B4%20%E2%86%92%20%E5%9B%9B%E7%B1%BB%E6%A6%82%E7%8E%87%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RIxaY%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uc9f46037\" id=\"uc9f46037\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b896e61\" id=\"u9b896e61\">但对于只有四个标签的任务，用 6 亿参数做这件事性价比不高，部署也比 BERT 重。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3aee8b4a\" id=\"u3aee8b4a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uffb6c046\" id=\"uffb6c046\">这个项目的选择</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"uce076afd\" id=\"uce076afd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u695e918d\" id=\"u695e918d\">第一阶段：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22BERT%2FBGE%EF%BC%9A%E8%B4%9F%E8%B4%A3%E4%B8%BB%E6%84%8F%E5%9B%BE%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%5Cn%E7%8E%B0%E6%9C%89%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%9A%E8%B4%9F%E8%B4%A3%E8%AE%BA%E6%96%87%E5%90%8D%E3%80%81%E4%BB%93%E5%BA%93%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E3%80%81%E9%99%84%E4%BB%B6%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E7%AD%89%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E6%80%A7%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%5Cn%E4%BD%8E%E7%BD%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%9A%E8%AE%A9%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E6%88%96%E4%BA%A4%E7%BB%99%20LLM%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22w5H0L%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u899dbd4b\" id=\"u899dbd4b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua62250ac\" id=\"ua62250ac\">第二阶段有足够的高质量标注数据后，再训练：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22Qwen3-0.6B%20%2B%20LoRA%5Cn%E2%86%92%20%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E6%84%8F%E5%9B%BE%E3%80%81%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E3%80%81%E7%BA%A6%E6%9D%9F%E5%92%8C%E8%BF%BD%E9%97%AE%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wqXaW%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u2eb0e9e5\" id=\"u2eb0e9e5\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc9bf097f\" id=\"uc9bf097f\">所以两者不是简单的“旧模型和新模型”区别。BERT 更像可靠的分类零件；千问更像能够理解并填写整张表格的小 Agent。对于当前第一版意图微服务，BERT 类模型更容易做对、测准和部署。</span></p>",
